          <span class="muted" style="font-size:0.8rem;display:inline-block;margin-top:0.35rem;">${vehicleAudit.rivExemption} Air Conditioning Excise Tax: $${vehicleAudit.airConditioningExciseTaxCad} CAD.</span>
